OL,3,GNEWSAStaff suspended at mental health
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of staff have been suspended
OL,7,Ffrom a mental health hospital that has
OL,8,Fbeen at the centre of a safeguarding
OL,9,Finquiry.
OL,11,FEarlier this year, the trust that runs
OL,12,FWotton Lawn, in Gloucester, referred
OL,13,Fitself to the county council for what
OL,14,Fis know as a section 42 investigation
OL,15,Ffollowing safety concerns. One patient
OL,16,Fhas told the BBC: "I didn't feel like
OL,17,Fanybody cared enough."
OL,19,FGloucestershire Health and Care NHS
OL,20,FFoundation Trust said it did not
OL,21,Fcomment on "internal processes" but
OL,22,Fsaid it was improving services.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
