OL,3,GNEWSAStaff suspended at mental health
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FGloucestershire County Council said it
OL,7,Fwould not release details of the
OL,8,Finquiry, which has now finished,
OL,9,Fbecause the information "could lead to
OL,10,Fpatients being identifiable".
